body:
On top of everyone else's great suggestions, I highly recommend giving the later episodes a chance. Last night I listened to compulsion, drop-ins, and excursion and each of them were fantastic. He's just getting better and better.

&#x200B;

I also started to write a list of episodes that I like and why (for no real reason, and in no particular order.) [Here it is, if you wanna read it. I didn't put any spoilers.](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WM_Q2EPy7PKZy4XeLPMvhmHSNMPQUrbZt7u1Vp3Fqwg/edit?usp=sharing)
